    },
    {
      "text": "Fry up the bacon until it's crispy. Set the bacon aside, but save the grease in the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-58778-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add butter to the pan. Fry the chicken in the bacon grease and butter. Shred chicken with the fat from the pan, and season it with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-58778-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop up the lettuce then place it on your serving plate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-58778-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken-step-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top the lettuce with the chicken, bacon, tomatoes, and a dollop of the garlic mayonnaise.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-blt-salad-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-58778-step-0-4",
